</div>

<section class="landing-section" id="solutions">
    <div class="landing-section-header">
        <div class="landing-section-eyebrow">Use cases</div>
        <h2>One platform, every kind of app.</h2>
        <p class="landing-section-sub">
            From server-rendered web apps to native mobile, Vaultex handles the protocol so you can
            focus on the product.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="landing-usecases">
        <a href="/docs/guides/dotnet" class="landing-usecase">
            <div class="landing-usecase-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                    <path d="M20 18c1.1 0 1.99-.9 1.99-2L22 6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v10c0 1.1.9 2 2 2H0v2h24v-2h-4z"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3>Server-rendered web apps</h3>
                <p>Cookie-based sessions backed by OIDC. Works with ASP.NET Core, Express, Django, Rails, and any framework that supports OAuth.</p>
            </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/guides/spa" class="landing-usecase">
            <div class="landing-usecase-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                    <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zm0 18l-10-5v-3l10 5 10-5v3l-10 5z"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3>Single-page apps</h3>
                <p>Authorization Code flow with PKCE in the browser. No client secret, no compromise on security. React, Vue, Angular, Svelte.</p>
            </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/guides/mobile" class="landing-usecase">
            <div class="landing-usecase-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                    <path d="M17 1H7c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v18c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h10c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V3c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 18H7V5h10v14z"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3>Native mobile apps</h3>
                <p>iOS and Android via the AppAuth library. System browser sign-in, secure token storage, biometric step-up.</p>
            </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/guides/node" class="landing-usecase">
            <div class="landing-usecase-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                    <path d="M9.4 16.6L4.8 12l4.6-4.6L8 6l-6 6 6 6 1.4-1.4zm5.2 0L19.2 12l-4.6-4.6L16 6l6 6-6 6-1.4-1.4z"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3>Backend APIs</h3>
                <p>Validate access tokens with the JWKS endpoint and standard JWT libraries. No round-trips to Vaultex on every request.</p>
            </div>
        </a>
    </div>
</section>

